Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.4.33-rt47 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.4.33 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: fb328d29f2b79553960a2ec6436a6408afd4db82


Or to build 3.4.33-rt47 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.4.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.4.33.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.4/patch-3.4.33-rt47.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve



